WEBVTT

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:08.307
Candy is finally meeting
Grandfather William.

00:00:08.457 --> 00:00:13.237
Grandfather is right there,
just before her.

00:00:13.387 --> 00:00:17.784
She can't say a word...

00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:23.154
Grandfather Williams turns back.

00:00:25.493 --> 00:00:30.095
The flowers bloom on Pony's Hill.

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:36.836
Hi, Candy.

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:39.038
Mr. Albert!

00:00:40.841 --> 00:00:44.103
Mr. Albert, why are you here?

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:48.638
You have to hide, quickly,
otherwise you will be found!

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:58.184
Candy, I don't have to hide.
My name is William Albert Adley.

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:01.754
William Albert Adley...

00:01:01.904 --> 00:01:06.391
Yes, this is my name.
I am the mysterious Grandfather William.

00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:10.963
Mr. Albert is Grandfather William?

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.965
It's a bit hard to believe, I know.

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:17.670
Grand Aunt Elroy had the idea
to pretend I'm a very old man.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.838
Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:27.984
My parents died when I was very young.
I became the heir of the family.

00:01:28.522 --> 00:01:32.685
But I was too young
to assume the responsibility.

00:01:32.835 --> 00:01:38.824
Grand Aunt asked my father's sister
to take care of my education.

00:01:38.974 --> 00:01:45.896
But I liked animals very much.
The aunt was terribly worried.

00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:54.611
This is our heir,
playing all day with the animals!

00:01:54.779 --> 00:01:59.311
I'm afraid for the family's future!

00:02:01.856 --> 00:02:10.920
Grand Aunt Elroy protected my identity
by giving me the title of Grandfather.

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:15.161
This secret was known
only by a handful of people.

00:02:15.311 --> 00:02:25.807
Nobody is to know
until he grows up!

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:32.927
This is also how George became
my protector.

00:02:33.077 --> 00:02:39.185
Grandfather William is Mr. Albert...

00:02:42.563 --> 00:02:45.862
Mr. Albert and Grandfather William
are the same person...

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:48.928
What's wrong, Candy?

00:02:49.078 --> 00:02:55.203
Nothing, I always thought
Grandfather William was an old man.

00:02:55.743 --> 00:03:00.339
Everyone thought so.
Even Stear and Archie and the others.

00:03:00.489 --> 00:03:01.373
Stear...

00:03:01.523 --> 00:03:08.981
You are the lord of the family,
why didn't you go to the funeral?

00:03:09.131 --> 00:03:13.786
I wanted to go,
and pray with the others.

00:03:13.936 --> 00:03:18.924
But I couldn't,
before being officially recognized.

00:03:19.074 --> 00:03:23.265
So I mourned alone.

00:03:46.193 --> 00:03:48.127
Candy, let's go out.

00:03:55.369 --> 00:03:58.797
This place is full of memories.

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:04.936
I wanted to think it over
before revealing my true identity.

00:04:06.714 --> 00:04:10.541
This place brings back
a lot of memories to me too.

00:04:10.691 --> 00:04:13.412
Candy, do you remember the waterfall?

00:04:13.562 --> 00:04:16.015
Of course!

00:04:16.165 --> 00:04:17.785
Let's go there and have a look.

00:04:48.389 --> 00:04:51.951
This is the first place I met you.

00:04:52.101 --> 00:04:55.655
My boat was rushing to the waterfall.

00:04:58.332 --> 00:05:02.996
Help! Anthony!

00:05:09.376 --> 00:05:11.105
Are you awake?

00:05:17.217 --> 00:05:24.680
I saved you, why did you faint?
My looks must have scared her.

00:05:26.493 --> 00:05:31.090
Now, I understand, it's not surprising
at all why you were here.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.992
This was your place.

00:05:33.142 --> 00:05:36.764
But always with a lot of animals!

00:05:41.608 --> 00:05:43.735
Ah, I really missed this place!

00:05:49.116 --> 00:05:51.107
Nothing changed at all.

00:05:54.054 --> 00:05:56.113
Poope!

00:05:59.126 --> 00:06:01.854
Poope is very happy to be here.
He comes often to play.

00:06:02.004 --> 00:06:05.262
He has his memories too.

00:06:10.337 --> 00:06:15.604
Nothing changed at all. Do you
remember all those animals of yours?

00:06:16.343 --> 00:06:18.072
Lovely!

00:06:20.147 --> 00:06:24.009
You passed the test,
My friends accepted you.

00:06:24.159 --> 00:06:28.214
My name is Candy.
Let's be friends!

00:06:28.822 --> 00:06:35.193
Not long after we met,
Mrs. Leagan sent me to Mexico.

00:06:35.929 --> 00:06:40.459
And I had to hide you
from those who came after you.

00:06:40.609 --> 00:06:45.699
You saved me so many times!
Even from those thieves!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.797
Then, it was you again, Mr. Albert...

00:07:18.947 --> 00:07:23.571
This is a letter
from Grandfather William.

00:07:25.479 --> 00:07:34.483
'I've decided to adopt Candice White
as a member of the Adley family.'

00:07:35.289 --> 00:07:38.349
I am the adopted daughter
of Grandfather William!

00:07:38.926 --> 00:07:43.422
Mr. Albert, why did you take
the decision to adopt me?

00:07:43.572 --> 00:07:51.029
Because Stear, Archie and Anthony
wrote me a letter,

00:07:51.438 --> 00:07:55.135
begging me to adopt you.

00:07:55.909 --> 00:08:01.306
Also, you reminded me very much
of Anthony's mother.

00:08:01.456 --> 00:08:08.253
Anthony's mother...
Anthony told me the same, once.

00:08:08.789 --> 00:08:14.421
She was very nice and gentle.
She was also my big sister.

00:08:15.195 --> 00:08:18.490
Anthony's mother...
Mr. Albert's sister!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:25.403
When my sister died, I was very upset,
so I left everything I had.

00:08:25.639 --> 00:08:31.103
Poor Mr. Albert!
He has very sad memories too!

00:08:31.253 --> 00:08:38.175
I remember... He came to encourage me
when Anthony passed away.

00:08:39.786 --> 00:08:45.317
Candy, don't be sad all your life.
You must carry on.

00:08:45.467 --> 00:08:47.121
Mr. Albert!

00:08:47.628 --> 00:08:50.956
Everybody has to face the loss
of someone he or she loves.

00:08:51.106 --> 00:08:54.933
Be strong, Candy,
you can take control of your life.

00:09:05.812 --> 00:09:11.642
I made you leave far away from America,
to forget about the pain.

00:09:11.792 --> 00:09:15.653
So you sent me to London,
to St. Paul Academy.

00:09:33.974 --> 00:09:37.616
Candy, do you have a grudge
against me for having done this?

00:09:37.766 --> 00:09:44.308
Why? It was an important
turning point in my life.

00:09:58.265 --> 00:10:01.159
I miss London.

00:10:01.309 --> 00:10:07.933
It is where I met Patty,
and it's where I saw Annie again.

00:10:08.083 --> 00:10:11.570
And we had a very good time,
along with Archie and Stear.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:16.548
Eliza and Neil were very mean to me,
and my friends comforted me.

00:10:16.883 --> 00:10:20.080
And then, one day,
Terry came to my help too.

00:10:20.988 --> 00:10:25.425
One night, he came to my room.
He was hurt.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:31.629
I escaped in the middle of the night to get
some medicine, and I met you, Mr. Albert.

00:10:32.432 --> 00:10:33.692
Mr. Albert!

00:10:33.842 --> 00:10:35.260
I haven't seen you for a long time!

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:38.530
It's really you, Mr. Albert!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:42.867
I didn't expect to see you in London.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:48.802
It was quite mysterious
to meet you in London, by chance.

00:10:48.952 --> 00:10:53.478
But chance had nothing to do with it,
Mr. Albert, you came there to protect me.

00:10:53.628 --> 00:10:57.382
That's when I realized
how much were you in love with Terry.

00:10:57.532 --> 00:10:59.049
Terry...

00:10:59.559 --> 00:11:08.193
I knew he could take care of you,
so I dedicated myself to my hobby.

00:11:08.343 --> 00:11:10.228
You started working at the zoo.

00:11:10.378 --> 00:11:11.530
Yes.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:20.673
I remember the day when I ran away
and brought you Patty's turtle.

00:11:22.182 --> 00:11:30.248
You knew I was punished,
so you sent me two costumes.

00:11:34.428 --> 00:11:41.800
Something is odd about these costumes.
They are Romeo and Juliet!

00:11:42.436 --> 00:11:51.344
There are even two wigs, did Grandfather
forget whether I was a boy or a girl?

00:11:52.045 --> 00:11:55.278
But, I have a great idea.

00:11:57.317 --> 00:12:03.688
I thought you could use the costumes
to escape and not being recognized.

00:12:04.991 --> 00:12:07.926
Thanks to you,
I really enjoyed the day.

00:12:24.845 --> 00:12:30.609
One day, George wrote me a letter
telling me you had left the school.

00:12:30.759 --> 00:12:35.747
Me too, I had to find my own way.

00:12:35.897 --> 00:12:42.284
And at last, you wrote me to tell me
you had decided to become a nurse.

00:12:42.963 --> 00:12:51.129
I wanted to come back
and reveal to you who I am.

00:12:51.279 --> 00:12:55.732
That's when the explosion happened.

00:13:10.857 --> 00:13:17.289
I know who this man is...

00:13:17.439 --> 00:13:19.855
It can't be!

00:13:20.534 --> 00:13:23.462
I was so surprised
to find you in Chicago!

00:13:23.612 --> 00:13:28.450
Candy, thank you
for everything you did for me.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.002
You were very kind to me
and I am grateful to you.

00:13:31.152 --> 00:13:37.744
Don't thank me, you're the one
who has always been there for me.

00:13:41.521 --> 00:13:45.984
As my memory came back, I was able
to put the puzzle back together.

00:13:46.134 --> 00:13:49.988
I had to find a way to contact George
in order to reveal my identity.

00:13:50.138 --> 00:13:55.594
Now I understand why you were talking
secretly with strangers.

00:13:55.744 --> 00:13:59.731
But if you came here to see me,
it's because you had something to tell me?

00:13:59.881 --> 00:14:02.834
Yes, something terrible is happening,
I almost forgot to tell you!

00:14:02.984 --> 00:14:07.539
I am forced to marry Neil!

00:14:08.281 --> 00:14:11.810
They are saying it's an order
from Grandfather William!

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:15.380
I never said such a thing!

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:18.483
Then it must be
Mrs. Leagan's doing.

00:14:18.633 --> 00:14:24.222
Candy, no one can force you
to do anything.

00:14:24.372 --> 00:14:27.392
Leave it to me,
I will straighten everything out.

00:14:27.542 --> 00:14:30.160
Thank you, Mr. Albert.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:32.247
Don't cry, Candy.

00:14:32.407 --> 00:14:35.004
But, but...

00:14:35.208 --> 00:14:37.676
Dry your tears.

00:14:39.846 --> 00:14:48.754
Candy, why don't you go back to
Pony's Home and relax for a little bit.

00:15:24.891 --> 00:15:28.452
I haven't been here for a long time!
It's the same, nothing changed!

00:15:32.565 --> 00:15:35.727
I missed this place so much!

00:15:35.877 --> 00:15:41.763
I would like to come here someday with
all my loved ones. But some of them...

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.873
Anthony!

00:15:52.118 --> 00:15:55.554
Stear!

00:15:57.991 --> 00:16:01.586
Terry!

00:16:04.731 --> 00:16:08.599
Good bye, all of you!
Goodbye, sweet memories!

00:16:10.003 --> 00:16:15.168
What's this? Bangpipes?
I remember this tune...

00:16:15.508 --> 00:16:17.476
This is... the prince of the hill!

00:16:25.218 --> 00:16:29.621
The prince on the hill,
he's right there!

00:16:45.472 --> 00:16:47.027
Who are you?

00:16:47.177 --> 00:16:48.900
Who do you think I am?

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.803
You look funny,
like an extra-terrestrial.

00:16:51.953 --> 00:16:53.539
An extra-terrestrial?

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:58.677
You're a boy, but you wear a skirt
and play a strange flute.

00:16:58.827 --> 00:17:03.949
A skirt? This is
the traditional kilt from Scotland.

00:17:04.099 --> 00:17:08.757
And this instrument is a bagpipe.

00:17:11.331 --> 00:17:15.527
It sounds very funny.
Like a bee hive!

00:17:15.677 --> 00:17:19.436
A bee hive! Good one!

00:17:23.276 --> 00:17:26.938
You are cuter when you smile.

00:17:27.188 --> 00:17:28.705
Wait!

00:17:31.951 --> 00:17:36.888
This is beautiful!
He must have lost it. Hey!

00:17:45.498 --> 00:17:47.193
Mr. Albert?

00:17:47.368 --> 00:17:49.528
Hi, Candy.

00:17:56.176 --> 00:17:58.838
You have the same pendant...

00:17:59.979 --> 00:18:03.742
Then, Mr. Albert...
You are the prince of the hill!

00:18:03.892 --> 00:18:09.016
Candy, we share
the same memories of youth.

00:18:13.159 --> 00:18:19.287
I see my prince again... at last!

00:18:22.902 --> 00:18:27.396
Candy!

00:18:27.774 --> 00:18:29.867
Annie, Archie!

00:18:30.477 --> 00:18:34.606
- This is a funny instrument!
- Can I play it too?

00:18:34.756 --> 00:18:37.343
Everyone's quite curious!

00:18:37.851 --> 00:18:40.183
Candy, look at this.

00:18:41.554 --> 00:18:42.914
Terry!

00:18:43.064 --> 00:18:47.752
The young star of the Strasford troupe,
Terrius G. Grandchester, came back.

00:18:47.902 --> 00:18:54.164
Terry came back to the theatre,
with Suzanna! This is great news!

00:18:58.004 --> 00:19:02.167
Terry went back into acting,
Archie and Annie are here,

00:19:02.317 --> 00:19:07.407
and I finally found my prince.
Everything is all right.

00:19:07.647 --> 00:19:11.342
Candy, the banquet will start,
let's go!

00:19:11.492 --> 00:19:14.484
Good! Let's run, everyone!

00:19:16.623 --> 00:19:17.606
Hurry, hurry!

00:19:17.766 --> 00:19:20.223
Wait!

00:19:25.865 --> 00:19:29.528
- I am already here!
- Candy is first!

00:19:29.702 --> 00:19:33.598
You will never change!

00:19:33.748 --> 00:19:36.768
Yes, why did you leave
the guests behind?

00:19:36.918 --> 00:19:42.640
Hurry, Mr. Albert, Archie and Annie!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.910
Candy!

00:19:45.151 --> 00:19:48.213
Tom and Jimmy are here too!

00:19:48.363 --> 00:19:50.148
This is a wonderful day.
Everyone's here.

00:19:50.298 --> 00:19:54.626
Come and help me with the party.

00:20:04.938 --> 00:20:08.339
Candy's delicious cake is ready!

00:20:13.947 --> 00:20:16.882
Mina, this is not for you!

00:20:17.383 --> 00:20:19.010
What...

00:20:21.221 --> 00:20:25.717
How wonderful it is to be
together again! Candy, a toast!

00:20:25.867 --> 00:20:29.662
For all my loved ones.
Be happy!

00:20:29.867 --> 00:20:34.602
And for all the children
from Pony's Home! Cheers!

00:20:35.335 --> 00:20:37.354
Cheers!

00:21:02.262 --> 00:21:07.592
Candy is as calm as the wind
blowing on the hill.

00:21:07.742 --> 00:21:14.334
Now, no matter what happens,
she knows she can live strongly.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.000
THE END
